&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;leading&amp;nbsp;Internet&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;launching&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;new,&amp;nbsp;high‑priority&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;initiative&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;North&amp;nbsp;America.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;greenfield&amp;nbsp;US&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;looking&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Forward&amp;nbsp;Deployment&amp;nbsp;Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;act&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;primary&amp;nbsp;bridge&amp;nbsp;between&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlike&amp;nbsp;traditional&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;roles,&amp;nbsp;this&amp;nbsp;position&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;customer‑centric&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;responsible&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;end‑to‑end&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;experience—from&amp;nbsp;onboarding&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;integration&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;ongoing&amp;nbsp;adoption&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;value&amp;nbsp;realization.&amp;nbsp;Your&amp;nbsp;success&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;measured&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;lines&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;code,&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;customer&amp;nbsp;satisfaction,&amp;nbsp;retention,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;expansion&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;You&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;closely&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;(both&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;business)&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;ensure&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;AI‑powered&amp;nbsp;solutions&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;deployed&amp;nbsp;smoothly,&amp;nbsp;adopted&amp;nbsp;widely,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;deliver&amp;nbsp;tangible&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;ideal&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;someone&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;enjoys&amp;nbsp;solving&amp;nbsp;real‑world&amp;nbsp;problems,&amp;nbsp;has&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;knack&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;translating&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;concepts&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;language,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;takes&amp;nbsp;pride&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;making&amp;nbsp;customers&amp;nbsp;successful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Delivery&amp;nbsp;Journey:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Lead&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;onboarding,&amp;nbsp;deployment&amp;nbsp;planning,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;integration&amp;nbsp;execution&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer&amp;nbsp;Success&amp;nbsp;Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proactively&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;health,&amp;nbsp;usage&amp;nbsp;patterns,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;satisfaction;&amp;nbsp;drive&amp;nbsp;adoption&amp;nbsp;campaigns&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;quarterly&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Needs&amp;nbsp;Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;understand&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;goals,&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;constraints,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;success&amp;nbsp;criteria&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;then&amp;nbsp;define&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;optimal&amp;nbsp;deployment&amp;nbsp;approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative&amp;nbsp;Integration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;internal&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;teams&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;deliver&amp;nbsp;custom&amp;nbsp;integrations&amp;nbsp;(APIs,&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;pipelines,&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;platforms)&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;write&amp;nbsp;production‑grade&amp;nbsp;code&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;scratch,&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;review,&amp;nbsp;test,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;troubleshoot&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;integrations&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;scripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Conduct&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;workshops&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;training&amp;nbsp;sessions&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;client&amp;nbsp;administrators&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;end‑users&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;ensure&amp;nbsp;self‑sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Issue&amp;nbsp;Resolution:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Act&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;first&amp;nbsp;point&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;contact&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;issues&amp;nbsp;during&amp;nbsp;deployment;&amp;nbsp;escalate&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;bugs&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;engineering&amp;nbsp;while&amp;nbsp;providing&amp;nbsp;clear&amp;nbsp;communication&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Voice&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;Customer:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Synthesize&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;feedback&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;deployment&amp;nbsp;patterns&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;actionable&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;improvement&amp;nbsp;suggestions,&amp;nbsp;influencing&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;product&amp;nbsp;roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;Bring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;customer‑facing&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;such&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Customer&amp;nbsp;Success&amp;nbsp;Engineer,&amp;nbsp;Solutions&amp;nbsp;Consultant,&amp;nbsp;Implementation&amp;nbsp;Consultant,&amp;nbsp;Technical&amp;nbsp;Account&amp;nbsp;Manager&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;FDE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track&amp;nbsp;record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;successfully&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;solutions&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;external&amp;nbsp;clients,&amp;nbsp;managing&amp;nbsp;multiple&amp;nbsp;projects&amp;nbsp;simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;working&amp;nbsp;directly&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;non‑technical&amp;nbsp;executives&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;staff&amp;nbsp;(developers,&amp;nbsp;IT&amp;nbsp;ops).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical&amp;nbsp;Understanding&amp;nbsp;(not&amp;nbsp;deep&amp;nbsp;coding):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;modern&amp;nbsp;web&amp;nbsp;technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(REST&amp;nbsp;APIs,&amp;nbsp;cloud&amp;nbsp;infrastructure,&amp;nbsp;databases)&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;enough&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;read&amp;nbsp;code,&amp;nbsp;debug&amp;nbsp;basic&amp;nbsp;issues,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;write&amp;nbsp;simple&amp;nbsp;scripts&amp;nbsp;(Python,&amp;nbsp;JavaScript,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;cloud&amp;nbsp;platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(AWS/Azure/GCP)&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;conceptual&amp;nbsp;level&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;know&amp;nbsp;how&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;deploy&amp;nbsp;services,&amp;nbsp;configure&amp;nbsp;networking&amp;nbsp;basics,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;monitor&amp;nbsp;logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI/ML&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;plus&amp;nbsp;(LLMs,&amp;nbsp;agents,&amp;nbsp;RAG),&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;not&amp;nbsp;mandatory&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;learn&amp;nbsp;on&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;triage&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;issues&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;whether&amp;nbsp;it&#39;s&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;configuration,&amp;nbsp;data,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;code&amp;nbsp;problem,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;route&amp;nbsp;accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft&amp;nbsp;Skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Customer&amp;nbsp;Success&amp;nbsp;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional&amp;nbsp;communication&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;presentation&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;explain&amp;nbsp;complex&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;concepts&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;leaders&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;translate&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;needs&amp;nbsp;into&amp;nbsp;technical&amp;nbsp;requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong&amp;nbsp;empathy&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;active&amp;nbsp;listening&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;customers&amp;nbsp;trust&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;because&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;understand&amp;nbsp;their&amp;nbsp;pain&amp;nbsp;points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project&amp;nbsp;management&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;organizational&amp;nbsp;skills&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;juggle&amp;nbsp;multiple&amp;nbsp;accounts&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;timelines&amp;nbsp;without&amp;nbsp;dropping&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;ball.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem‑solving&amp;nbsp;orientation&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;shy&amp;nbsp;away&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;ambiguity&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;comfortable&amp;nbsp;making&amp;nbsp;decisions&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;incomplete&amp;nbsp;information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self‑starter&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;thrive&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;fast‑paced,&amp;nbsp;greenfield&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;minimal&amp;nbsp;handholding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;Have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Customer&amp;nbsp;Success&amp;nbsp;platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Gainsight,&amp;nbsp;Totango,&amp;nbsp;Salesforce)&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;ticketing&amp;nbsp;systems&amp;nbsp;(Jira,&amp;nbsp;Zendesk).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;startup&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;hyper‑growth&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;enterprise&amp;nbsp;integration&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;patterns&amp;nbsp;(e.g.,&amp;nbsp;SFTP,&amp;nbsp;ETL,&amp;nbsp;SOAP,&amp;nbsp;OAuth).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on&amp;nbsp;experience&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;any&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI/GenAI&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;products&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;either&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;user&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;implementer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;Offer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive&amp;nbsp;base&amp;nbsp;salary&amp;nbsp;+&amp;nbsp;performance&amp;nbsp;bonus/equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive&amp;nbsp;health,&amp;nbsp;dental,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;vision&amp;nbsp;insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k)&amp;nbsp;with&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;match.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible&amp;nbsp;PTO&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;remote&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Early‑hire&amp;nbsp;advantage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Be&amp;nbsp;one&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;first&amp;nbsp;US&amp;nbsp;team&amp;nbsp;members,&amp;nbsp;help&amp;nbsp;shape&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;delivery&amp;nbsp;playbook&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;intersection&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;cutting‑edge&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;enterprise&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;career‑defining&amp;nbsp;experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;Role?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;FDE&amp;nbsp;title&amp;nbsp;may&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;technical,&amp;nbsp;but&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;its&amp;nbsp;core&amp;nbsp;it’s&amp;nbsp;about&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;bridging&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;gap&amp;nbsp;between&amp;nbsp;innovation&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;real‑world&amp;nbsp;value&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In&amp;nbsp;2025–2026,&amp;nbsp;companies&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;moving&amp;nbsp;beyond&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;demos&amp;nbsp;–&amp;nbsp;they&amp;nbsp;need&amp;nbsp;people&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;can&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;deliver&amp;nbsp;results&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;make&amp;nbsp;customers&amp;nbsp;love&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;product&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;This&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;offers&amp;nbsp;you&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;autonomy,&amp;nbsp;visibility,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;that&amp;nbsp;you’d&amp;nbsp;expect&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;founding‑level&amp;nbsp;position,&amp;nbsp;without&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;risk&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;true&amp;nbsp;startup.&amp;nbsp;Join&amp;nbsp;us&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;something&amp;nbsp;new&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;ground&amp;nbsp;up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&amp;nbsp;are&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;equal&amp;nbsp;opportunity&amp;nbsp;employer.&amp;nbsp;All&amp;nbsp;qualified&amp;nbsp;applicants&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;receive&amp;nbsp;consideration&amp;nbsp;without&amp;nbsp;regard&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;race,&amp;nbsp;color,&amp;nbsp;religion,&amp;nbsp;sex,&amp;nbsp;sexual&amp;nbsp;orientation,&amp;nbsp;gender&amp;nbsp;identity,&amp;nbsp;national&amp;nbsp;origin,&amp;nbsp;disability,&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;veteran&amp;nbsp;status.&amp;nbsp;Candidates&amp;nbsp;must&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;authorized&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;United&amp;nbsp;States.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; (AI Desktop &amp;amp; Mobile App)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Title: GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Operations - Contractor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Mountain View, California&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Type: Contractor , On-site&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be working on a brand-new AI voice agent product focused on transforming voice input into a polished communication experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive US user growth and go-to-market execution across multiple acquisition and community channels including YouTube, Tiktok, Reddit, LinkedIn, Product Hunt, influencer marketing, online communities, and emerging AI creator ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute GTM growth strategies for consumer AI products, including organic growth, content marketing, creator partnerships, launch campaigns, and user acquisition experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Design, and Engineering teams to shape product positioning, branding, messaging, launch strategies, and viral growth loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and test new growth channels, campaign concepts, and social content strategies tailored for AI consumer products and productivity tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor competitor products and emerging AI productivity/voice startups to identify market opportunities and differentiation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with influencers, creators, AI communities and conduct user interview to build brand awareness and user engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on-site at least 4 days a week in our Mountain View office, we provide free yummy lunch and dinner every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’d Like to See in You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in written and spoken Mandarin is a must-have skillset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of experience in growth, GTM strategy, product marketing, consumer app marketing, or operations roles within AI, SaaS, mobile apps, or creator economy products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience growing products through social and community-driven channels including TikTok, YouTube, Reddit, Product Hunt, Discord, influencer marketing, or creator partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding and hands on experience on consumer AI product trends, especially in AI productivity, AI voice, AI creator tools for image/ideo generation, AI vibe coding etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and storytelling skills with the ability to craft compelling positioning and messaging for AI consumer products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for AI-native products and excitement about shaping the future of voice agents and AI-powered communication experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission alignment: If you want to be part of a team to accomplish this great mission, we will provide you the best possible platform to do that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self­-directed: We work best with people that are driven, motivated, and aspire to greatness. Are you the sort of person that, if you had time on your hands, will independently find interesting and useful things to do?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry to learn: We are eager to see you learn new skills and grow. But learning is hard work and this is something we hope you want to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team orientation: We work in small, fast­-moving teams. We don&#39;t believe in lone wolves. We watch out for each other and go after big goals together as a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hourly rate range: $35-$40, negotiable&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Mountain View, CA&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-Time, Onsite, Monday – Friday&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MediaGo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MediaGo DSP is transforming advertising with a next-generation, AI-driven programmatic platform. Our high-performance infrastructure and speed-to-market advantage make us one of the fastest-growing DSPs in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MediaGo is seeking a Head of Sales – North America to lead and scale our U.S. advertising sales organization. This executive will be responsible for developing and executing the company&#39;s sales strategy, driving sustainable revenue growth, expanding strategic advertiser and agency partnerships, and building a high-performing sales team. Reporting to senior leadership, the Head of Sales will play a key role in shaping MediaGo&#39;s go-to-market strategy and strengthening our position in the U.S. programmatic advertising market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a proven sales leader with deep expertise in programmatic advertising; native and display, a strong industry network, and a successful track record of building, leading, and scaling high-performing sales organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute the overall U.S. sales strategy to drive sustainable revenue growth and expand MediaGo&#39;s market presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and scale a high-performing advertising sales team, establishing clear performance expectations, KPIs, and career development plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the overall sales pipeline and forecasting process, ensuring consistent pipeline generation, accurate revenue projections, and achievement of company growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain executive-level relationships with advertisers, agencies, and strategic partners, while personally leading negotiations for high-value enterprise opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new market opportunities, industry verticals, and strategic partnerships to accelerate business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Account Management, Marketing, and Operations teams to ensure exceptional client experience, successful campaign execution, and long-term customer retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze market trends, competitive landscape, and customer needs to refine go-to-market strategies and identify new revenue opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and optimize sales processes, methodologies, and performance metrics to improve team productivity and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent MediaGo at industry conferences, client meetings, and executive events to strengthen the company&#39;s brand and industry presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular business updates, sales forecasts, and strategic recommendations to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, Communications, or a related field; MBA is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in digital advertising sales, including at least 3 years in a sales leadership role within programmatic advertising, DSPs, ad tech, or digital media.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading high-performing sales teams and consistently exceeding revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the programmatic advertising ecosystem, including DSPs, SSPs, agencies, measurement, and performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network of relationships across advertisers, agencies, and key industry partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success developing and executing go-to-market strategies and scaling revenue in a high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership, communication, presentation, and negotiation skills, with the ability to influence executive stakeholders both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset with experience using data and market insights to drive strategic business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, hands-on leader who thrives in a fast-paced, evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation: $145K–$217K Base + Commission | $270K–$350 OTE | RSUs/Stock may be included depending on level&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do you want to be part of the AI revolution? Do you want to think out of the box, thriving on challenges in AI industry and have the desire to solve them? Do you want to work with a world-class team to explore the fast-growing AI hardware opportunities and impact on AI industry?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking forward to you joining us to collaborate, contribute, and revolutionize AI silicon and system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Low Power SoC Architect, you will have the opportunity to independently design and define the lower power subsystem and improve the power efficiency of AI engine, in both data center and edge SoC. You will collaborate with experienced designers, RTL engineers, system and software team, to explore feasibility of ideas, proof of concept and power performance improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and knowledge of lower power soc architecture and deep expertise in lower power subsystem, power efficient design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and drive lower power &amp;amp; most efficient BW to power SoC design, including arch features, RTL changes for low power design, topologies with floorplan/layout and other design aspects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with IPs architects to drive low power design, methodologies, techniques, and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive SoC level power convergence by using existing modeling tools and techniques, and developing new state of the art tools, flows, and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and proof of track in power optimization: perf@watt and perf/sq.mm modeling or analysis, is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good teamwork with communications and support to solve all levels of architecture definition from micro-architecture to system level to software architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in C/C++ and scripting languages such as Perl or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven and leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge or experience in automotive industry is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS or PhD in Electrical or Computer Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in both English and Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
