&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;R&amp;amp;D Software Engineer Lead &amp;amp; CISO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: &lt;/strong&gt;R&amp;amp;D Software Engineer Lead &amp;amp; CISO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Mountain View, CA&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full Time, Onsite&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About MediaGo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MediaGo DSP is revolutionizing advertising with a next-gen, AI-driven programmatic platform. Backed by 22 years of digital advertising expertise, our high-performance infrastructure and speed-to-market advantage makes us the fastest-growing DSP. As an R&amp;amp;D Lead, you’ll shape both cutting-edge AI products and security-first development from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking an experienced Lead Software Engineer to guide our product team in developing and deploying scalable, AI-enabled systems. You’ll take end-to-end ownership of major backend and data initiatives, mentor a team of engineers, and collaborate with Product, Research, Operation, Sales, and Information Security to maintain robust compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, and deployment of scalable, AI-driven backend and data systems, ensuring alignment with strategic objectives and performance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the end-to-end lifecycle of R&amp;amp;D projects, from concept through prototyping and deployment, ensuring timely delivery and adherence to quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership and mentorship to junior and mid-level engineers, fostering a collaborative and high-performance team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, data scientists, and other stakeholders to define project requirements and deliver innovative solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as Chief Information Security Officer (CISO) to develop, implement, and enforce information security policies and procedures, ensuring compliance with relevant regulations and industry best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular audits and risk assessments to identify vulnerabilities and ensure the integrity and confidentiality of information assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’d Like to See in You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of professional software development experience, with 2+ years in a lead or tech-lead role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong backend expertise: Java, C++, Scala, Python—plus cloud infrastructure (GCP, AWS) and data frameworks (e.g., Spark)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of algorithms, data structures, microservices, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with both SQL and NoSQL databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-honed software engineering practices: version control, CI/CD, unit testing, code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and deploying production-grade systems and mentoring engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, problem-solving, and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive leadership: self-directed, resourceful, and comfortable steering projects in ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for learning, innovation, and advancing AI-driven products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s in Computer Science, Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with security best practices (OWASP, secure coding, API security)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with compliance frameworks (e.g., NIST, ISO 27001, EO 14117)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerization, orchestration (Docker, Kubernetes), Infrastructure as Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Culture Fit&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission alignment&lt;/strong&gt;: If you want to use AI to dramatically improve people&#39;s lives, we will give you the best possible platform to realize this mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-directed&lt;/strong&gt;: We work best with people that are driven, motivated, and aspire to greatness. Are you the sort of person that, if you have time on your hands, will independently find interesting and useful things to do?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hungry to learn&lt;/strong&gt;: We are eager to teach you new skills. But learning is hard work and this is something we hope you want to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team orientation&lt;/strong&gt;: We work in small, fast-moving teams. We don&#39;t believe in lone wolves. We watch out for each other, and go after big goals together — as a team.Top of Form&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation : &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary Pay Range:&lt;/strong&gt; $159k – $229k USD&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Architect, design and implement new features, performance improvements, and ISA extensions in RISC-V CPU core generators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Microarchitecture development and specification. Ensure that knowledge is shared via great documentation and participation in a culture of collaborative design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Perform initial sandbox verification, and work with design verification team to create and execute thorough verification test plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Work with physical implementation team to implement and optimize physical design to meet frequency, area, power goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Collaborate with performance modelling team for performance exploration and optimization to meet performance goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;• 8+ yrs of recent industry experience in high-performance, energy-efficient CPU designs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Expertise in CPU processor designs in one or more of the following areas: instruction fetch and decode; branch prediction; register renaming and instruction scheduling; scalar and/or vector execution units; load-store unit; cache and memory subsystems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Knowledge of RISC-V architecture is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Proficiency with hardware (RTL) design in Verilog, System Verilog, or VHDL.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Experience with Scala and/or Chisel is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Attention to detail and a focus on high-quality design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Ability to work well with others and a belief that engineering is a team sport.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Knowledge of at least one object-oriented and/or functional programming language.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;• Background of successful CPU development from architecture through tapeout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;• MS/ PhD degree in EE, CE, CS or a related technical discipline, or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Senior Strategic Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Location: Mountain View, CA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job Type: Full Time, Onsite, Monday - F­riday&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and driven individual for the position of Strategic Account Manager. As a key member of our Global Business Team, this strategic position will be responsible for managing and growing a portfolio of clients, conducting market research, and developing effective sales strategies. The successful candidate must have strong client facing skills, excellent account management abilities, and a deep understanding of project management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jslxg8&quot; data-start=&quot;1153&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Manage and grow a portfolio of strategic and enterprise clients through effective account management, driving long-term partnerships and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fw258r&quot; data-start=&quot;1308&quot; data-end=&quot;1438&quot;&gt;Build trusted client relationships by providing strategic guidance, proactive recommendations, and exceptional customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hjvun8&quot; data-start=&quot;1439&quot; data-end=&quot;1581&quot;&gt;Oversee campaign strategy and execution within the MediaGo DSP to maximize performance, client satisfaction, and incremental revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u232ml&quot; data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1744&quot;&gt;Analyze campaign performance and provide clear, data-driven insights and strategic recommendations through compelling client presentations and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cytqcg&quot; data-start=&quot;1745&quot; data-end=&quot;1877&quot;&gt;Own client-facing activities, including campaign briefings, status calls, quarterly business reviews, and executive presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rnvu89&quot; data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional collaboration with Sales, Product, Algorithm, and Analytics teams to ensure seamless campaign delivery and identify upsell and expansion opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f9hl8&quot; data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2160&quot;&gt;Resolve complex campaign and technical issues while serving as the primary escalation point for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pontiw&quot; data-start=&quot;2161&quot; data-end=&quot;2294&quot;&gt;Conduct market research to identify industry trends, competitive insights, and new business opportunities within existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rayco7&quot; data-start=&quot;2295&quot; data-end=&quot;2446&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Stay current on AdTech trends, platform updates, and best practices, and apply industry knowledge to improve campaign performance and client success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, marketing, or a related field 5+ years of experience in B2B ad sales or account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong client facing skills and the ability to build &amp;amp; maintain relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and results-driven with a proven track record of achieving or exceeding sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in Mandarin Chinese is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to be a self-starter &amp;amp; a team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the OKR Framework is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on-site 5 days a week in our Mountain View office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry to learn: If you’re hungry for knowledge, we can feed you with all the industry &amp;amp; technical skills the #AdTech world has to offer.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter: We work best with people that are driven, motivated, and aspiring to greatness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team orientation: We work in small, fast-moving pods. We don&#39;t believe in lone wolves but we do expect you to hold your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for an ambitious and driven individual to take their career to the next level and build a long-term career in the digital advertising space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated Base Salary Range:&lt;/strong&gt; $110,000–$200,000 USD&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Do you want to be part of the AI revolution? Do you want to think out of the box, thriving on challenges in AI industry and have the desire to solve them? Do you want to work with a world-class team to explore the fast-growing AI hardware opportunities and impact on AI industry?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking forward to you joining us to collaborate, contribute, and revolutionize AI silicon and system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a world-class Memory Subsystem Architect to join our SoC team at Baidu’s Sunnyvale office. The successful candidate will be a motivated self-starter who will thrive in this highly technical environment. Your job responsibilities as a Memory Subsystem Architect will be providing technical leadership through all phases of Baidu’s AI SoC development, but primarily focused on unified memory space architecture design for Baidu AI accelerator SoC. The working goal is to build unified memory space for thousands of accelerators from user&#39;s perspective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Developing architecture and micro-architecture to improve the state-of-the-art AI SoC memory system. Explore and evaluate the architectural design choices in SoC fabrics, system caches, system coherency, and MMUs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with software and SoC design team to define architecture and build unified memory space system across distributed AI training system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Hardware design, verification, emulation, and validation teams to build and test the hardware architecture, performance and functionality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in performance simulation of features to improve memory subsystem efficiency. Analyzing benchmarks, application workloads and performance simulation results to identify areas for microarchitecture optimizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debug performance and functional issues with high-level models, RTL simulation, and silicon.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in Silicon architecture or IP design mainly focusing on memory subsystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of distributed AI training system&#39;s requirement on SoC memory subsystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in HW digital design and understanding of CPU/HW Accelerators and/or Peripheral design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SW and Operating system practices and requirements on memory system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in System Performance analysis and debug in pre and/or Post-Silicon environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid background of System interconnect, System MMUs, Caches and Memory Technologies (e.g. HBM, GDDR, DDR and LPDDR4/5).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data analysis using Excel, Perl, Python etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master or PhD in Electrical or Computer Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in both English and Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture Fit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mission alignment: If you want to be part of a team to accomplish this great mission, we will provide you the best possible platform to do that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed: We work best with people that are driven, motivated, and aspire to greatness.&lt;/li&gt;
