&lt;p&gt;Work with Baidu’s AI SoC marketing and software architects to define technical Requirements &amp;amp; Architecture Specifications for chip development.&amp;nbsp; Work with the SoC design team &amp;amp; program management to develop costing estimates, power/area targets, resource plans and schedules for the technical implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
